From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:59:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: add empty-store Credential Management support

Expose a native SecureContext, SameObject CredentialsContainer using the Chrome 155.0.8059.40 Blink contract. Model an empty main-frame password store without creating, saving, or retrieving credentials.
---
 src/browser/js/Context.zig                  |   3 +
 src/browser/js/Env.zig                      |   3 +
 src/browser/js/bridge.zig                   |   1 +
 src/browser/webapi/CredentialsContainer.zig | 228 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/browser/webapi/Navigator.zig            |   8 +
 5 files changed, 243 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/browser/webapi/CredentialsContainer.zig

